# Netlify redirects — first match wins, so order matters.
# Keep the analytics proxy at the top: it must resolve before any catch-all.

# ---- Analytics proxy ----
# Umami is served from our own domain so script-src can stay 'self' (no CSP
# change in the six files that carry it) and ad-blockers filtering the vendor
# domain don't strip it. Harmless until the <script> tag in index.html is
# enabled — nothing requests these paths before then.
/js/script.js   https://cloud.umami.is/script.js   200
/api/send       https://cloud.umami.is/api/send    200

