# Canonicalise the .html form of the current demos. These must be explicit and
# forced: a ":param.html" pattern does NOT work (Netlify params match a whole
# path segment, so it captured every /demo/* URL and emitted a literal ":slug").
/demo/salt-and-iron.html  /demo/salt-and-iron   301!
/demo/the-orangery.html   /demo/the-orangery    301!
/demo/the-alder.html      /demo/the-alder       301!
/demo/kiln-coffee.html    /demo/kiln-coffee     301!

